OL,3,CMultiple firefighters battling large
OL,4,Cblaze at scrapyard in Talacre
OL,6,F75 emergency service personnel are at
OL,7,Fthe scene of a large fire at a
OL,8,Fscrapyard in Talacre, Flintshire.
OL,10,FNorth Wales Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,Fsaid crews had been called to deal
OL,12,Fwith an incident on Station Road on
OL,13,FSunday morning (26 July).
OL,15,FIn a statement, Service Delivery
OL,16,FManager for North Wales Fire and
OL,17,FRescue Service, Jami Jennings, said:
OL,19,F"We currently have 75 Fire and Rescue
OL,20,FService personnel and partner agencies
OL,21,Fin attendance.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/2
