OL,3,CMultiple firefighters battling large
OL,4,Cblaze at scrapyard in Talacre
OL,6,F"For your safety, please avoid the
OL,7,Farea and keep roads clear to allow
OL,8,Femergency vehicles access."
OL,10,FMembers of the public are also being
OL,11,Ftold to keep their windows and doors
OL,12,Fclosed if they can smell smoke.
